v><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Grounds\">Crystal Grounds</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Mushroom%20Gardens\">Mushroom Farms</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Middle%20Spike\">Middle Spike</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tCrystalcrushers prefer to fight in close combat.<br/><br/>A crystalcrusher attacks in melee range. A crystalcrusher never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fleshslicer\">Fleshslicer</a> was used as a template for the Crystalcrusher. On the Test Server for update 9.6 these were introduced in, CipSoft had forgotten to alter the loot of the Crystalcrusher, and e.g. <a href=\"#/wiki/Dung%20Ball%20%28Quest%29\">Dung Balls</a> could be looted from them.</li>\n<li>As announced on May 14, 2024, the patch reduced its DPS as part of the 2024 Balancing Project.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 25,269 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\